# Alertmanager's options. Loopback only: its API takes alerts and silences with
# no authentication, so the listener must never face the network. HA gossip is
# off (empty --cluster.listen-address). fleet-host-config.service installs this
# file and restarts prometheus-alertmanager.service when it changes
# (ansible/host.yml). Silences and the notification log live in the package's
# state directory, which the service user owns.
ARGS="--config.file=/etc/prometheus/alertmanager.yml --storage.path=/var/lib/prometheus/alertmanager --web.listen-address=127.0.0.1:9093 --cluster.listen-address="
